# Sky settings

option.vanillaSun=Sun Texture
option.vanillaSun.comment=When enabled, shows Minecraft's default sun texture. When disabled, uses the shader's procedural sun disc.
option.vanillaMoon=Moon Texture
option.vanillaMoon.comment=When enabled, shows Minecraft's default moon texture. When disabled, uses the shader's procedural moon disc.
option.sunAngularRadius=Sun Size
option.sunAngularRadius.comment=Adjusts the apparent size of the sun disc in the sky. Larger = bigger sun and softer shadows due to larger light source.
option.moonAngularRadius=Moon Size
option.moonAngularRadius.comment=Adjusts the apparent size of the moon disc at night. Larger = bigger moon and softer moon shadows.
option.planetBounce=Planet Bounce Light
option.planetBounce.comment=Ground-bounced sun and moonlight re-scattered through the air. Warms the horizon and downward views almost for free.
option.stars=Stars
option.stars.comment=Stars in the night sky. Low performance impact
option.starsIntensity=Intensity
option.starsIntensity.comment=Controls the brightness of stars in the night sky
option.starsCoverage=Coverage
option.starsCoverage.comment=Controls the number of stars in the night sky
option.galaxy=Galaxy
option.galaxy.comment=Galaxy image in the night sky
option.galaxyIntensity=Galaxy Intensity
option.galaxyIntensity.comment=Controls the brightness of the galaxy in the night sky
option.crepuscularRays=Crepuscular Rays
option.crepuscularRays.comment=Enables god rays (light shafts) visible when the sun is near the horizon through fog and clouds. Best seen at sunrise/sunset.
option.lightningFlash=Lightning Flash
option.rainbows=Rainbows
option.rainbows.comment=When enabled, a faint rainbow appears opposite the sun during and just after rain.
option.endSunEffect=End Sun Effect
option.endSunEffect.comment=Controls end sun effect.
option.atmosphereSaturationBoost=Atmosphere Saturation Boost
option.atmosphereSaturationBoost.comment=Increases the saturation of the sky and sunlight color depending on the time of day
option.atmosphereSaturationBoostIntensity=Saturation Boost Intensity
option.atmosphereSaturationBoostIntensity.comment=Adjust the intensity of Atmosphere Saturation Boost
option.atmosphereRainDesaturation=Atmosphere Rain Desaturation
option.atmosphereRainDesaturation.comment=Desaturates the atmosphere during rain, making for colder looking rain
option.atmosphereRainDesaturationIntensity=Desaturation Intensity
option.atmosphereRainDesaturationIntensity.comment=Adjust the intensity of Atmosphere Rain Desaturation

