option.fogMieAnisotropy=Fog Mie Anisotropy
option.fogMieAnisotropy.comment=Forward-scattering strength of fog. Higher glows toward sun and moon; 0 scatters evenly. Default 0.50.
option.mieColorR=§c▍ §fRed — Mie
option.mieColorR.comment=Red tint of Mie scattering (sky haze and air fog). 1.00 is the physical value; lowering it removes red from the haze, raising it warms it.
option.mieColorG=§a▍ §fGreen — Mie
option.mieColorG.comment=Green tint of Mie scattering (sky haze and air fog). 1.00 is the physical value.
option.mieColorB=§9▍ §fBlue — Mie
option.mieColorB.comment=Blue tint of Mie scattering (sky haze and air fog). 1.00 is the physical value; raising it cools the haze.
