option.ssptSPP=Samples per Pixel
option.ssptSPP.comment=Paths traced per pixel per frame. More samples = less noise, more cost.
option.ssptBounces=Bounces
option.ssptBounces.comment=Path bounces per sample. More bounces = more colored light bleed.
option.ssptEmissionDistance=Emission Distance
option.ssptEmissionDistance.comment=How far colored emission carries before fading out (blocks).
option.ssptLightmapBlend=Lightmap Blending
option.ssptLightmapBlend.comment=How strongly the vanilla lightmap blocklight blends into the SSPT accumulation.
option.ssptEmissionMode=Emission Mode
option.ssptEmissionMode.comment=Emission source used by SSPT. Only affects SSPT.
value.ssptEmissionMode.0=Hardcoded
value.ssptEmissionMode.1=Hardcoded + LabPBR
value.ssptEmissionMode.2=LabPBR Only
option.ssptIntensity=SSPT Intensity
option.ssptIntensity.comment=Global brightness multiplier for the SSPT indirect emission contribution.
option.framingTool=Framing Tool
option.framingTool.comment=Master toggle for composition guides (rule-of-thirds, aspect box, safe area). For lining up screenshots.
option.framingThirds=Thirds Grid
option.framingThirds.comment=Rule-of-thirds grid overlay.
option.framingAspect=Aspect Guides
option.framingAspect.comment=Target aspect-ratio box and safe-area guides.
option.framingOpacity=Guide Opacity
option.framingOpacity.comment=Guide line opacity.
option.framingLineWidth=Line Width
option.framingLineWidth.comment=Guide line thickness in pixels.
option.framingAspectRatio=Aspect Ratio
option.framingAspectRatio.comment=Target aspect ratio (width over height) for the crop box.
option.framingSafeArea=Safe Area
option.framingSafeArea.comment=Centered safe-area fraction shown inside the aspect box.
option.maxFrames=Max Accumulated Frames
option.maxFrames.comment=Temporal history length. Higher = smoother, but more ghosting.
option.svgfFilter=Filtering
option.svgfFilter.comment=SVGF a-trous filter: removes the remaining SSPT noise edge-aware.
option.svgfRad=Filter Radius
option.svgfRad.comment=Tap radius of each a-trous filter iteration.
option.svgfStrictness=Luminance Strictness
option.svgfStrictness.comment=How aggressively the filter preserves brightness differences.
option.svgfNormalexp=Normal Weight
option.svgfNormalexp.comment=How strongly surface normal differences block filtering across edges.

option.fogSmoothing=Fog Smoothing
option.fogSmoothing.comment=Edge-aware blur on the fog buffer against blocky artifacts. Current-frame only, so no smearing on fast movement. Cheap.
option.fogSmoothingRadius=Fog Blur Radius
option.fogSmoothingRadius.comment=Fog blur radius. Higher is softer at higher cost, while respecting hard density edges.
option.netherSmoke=Nether Smoke
option.netherSmoke.comment=Turbulent Nether smoke replacing the flat fog glow, with ember-bright proximity glow. Falls back to classic fog when off.
option.netherSmokeIntensity=Nether Smoke Intensity
option.netherSmokeIntensity.comment=Brightness multiplier for the Nether Smoke v2 glow/emission. Only has an effect when Nether Smoke is enabled.



option.materialMappingMode=Material Mapping Mode
